### ============================================================
### 15-gRPC API & gRPC Testing (REST Port: 8115, gRPC Port: 9090)
### ============================================================

### 1. Kiểm tra REST API endpoint
GET http://localhost:8115/api/products/ping
Accept: application/json

### Ghi chú kiểm thử gRPC (Port: 9090):
# Bạn có thể dùng Postman (gRPC client) hoặc grpcurl để gọi các RPC đã định nghĩa:
# - Unary RPC: com.example.grpc.ProductService/GetProduct
# - Server Streaming: com.example.grpc.ProductService/ListProducts
# - Client Streaming: com.example.grpc.ProductService/BulkCreateProducts
# - Bidirectional Streaming: com.example.grpc.ProductService/PriceNegotiation
